{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":45,"verses":[{"n":0,"text":"For the Chief Musician. Set to “The Lilies.” A contemplation by the sons of Korah. A wedding song."},{"n":1,"text":"My heart overflows with a noble theme. I recite my verses for the king. My tongue is like the pen of a skillful writer.","tok":[{"t":"My","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" heart overflows "},{"t":"with","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"a","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" noble theme. "},{"t":"I","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" recite "},{"t":"my","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" verses "},{"t":"for","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"king","s":["H5921"]},{"t":". "},{"t":"My","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" tongue "},{"t":"is","s":["H1121"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"like","s":["H1121"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" pen "},{"t":"of","s":["H1121"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"a","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"skillful","s":["H4905"]},{"t":" writer."}]},{"n":2,"text":"You are the most excellent of the sons of men. Grace has anointed your lips, therefore God has blessed you forever.","tok":[{"t":"You","s":["H1697"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"are","s":["H1697"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H1697"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"most","s":["H4428"]},{"t":" excellent "},{"t":"of","s":["H4428"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H1697"]},{"t":" sons "},{"t":"of","s":["H4428"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"men","s":["H2896"]},{"t":". Grace "},{"t":"has","s":["H4428"]},{"t":" anointed "},{"t":"your","s":["H1697"]},{"t":" lips, therefore God "},{"t":"has","s":["H4428"]},{"t":" blessed "},{"t":"you","s":["H1697"]},{"t":" forever."}]},{"n":3,"text":"Strap your sword on your thigh, O mighty one, in your splendor and your majesty.","tok":[{"t":"Strap "},{"t":"your","s":["H5921"],"a":[2]},{"t":" sword "},{"t":"on","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"your","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" thigh, "},{"t":"O","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"mighty","s":["H1121"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"one","s":["H1121"]},{"t":", "},{"t":"in","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"your","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" splendor "},{"t":"and","s":["H1121"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"your","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" majesty."}]},{"n":4,"text":"In your majesty ride on victoriously on behalf of truth, humility, and righteousness. Let your right hand display awesome deeds.","tok":[{"t":"In","s":["H5921"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"your","s":["H5921"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"majesty","s":["H1926"],"a":[0]},{"t":" ride "},{"t":"on","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" victoriously "},{"t":"on","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"behalf","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"of","s":["H1368"]},{"t":" truth, humility, "},{"t":"and","s":["H2719"]},{"t":" righteousness. Let "},{"t":"your","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" right hand display awesome deeds."}]},{"n":5,"text":"Your arrows are sharp. The nations fall under you, with arrows in the heart of the king’s enemies.","tok":[{"t":"Your","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" arrows "},{"t":"are","s":["H1697"]},{"t":" sharp. "},{"t":"The","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" nations fall "},{"t":"under","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"you","s":["H5921"]},{"t":", "},{"t":"with","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" arrows "},{"t":"in","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" heart "},{"t":"of","s":["H1697"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"king","s":["H5921"]},{"t":"’s enemies."}]},{"n":6,"text":"Your throne, God, is forever and ever. A scepter of equity is the scepter of your kingdom.","tok":[{"t":"Your","s":["H5307"]},{"t":" throne, God, "},{"t":"is","s":["H3820"]},{"t":" forever "},{"t":"and","s":["H4428"]},{"t":" ever. "},{"t":"A","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" scepter "},{"t":"of","s":["H4428"]},{"t":" equity "},{"t":"is","s":["H3820"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H8478"]},{"t":" scepter "},{"t":"of","s":["H4428"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"your","s":["H5307"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"kingdom","s":["H4428"]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":7,"text":"You have loved righteousness, and hated wickedness. Therefore God, your God, has anointed you with the oil of gladness above your fellows.","tok":[{"t":"You","s":["H5703"]},{"t":" have loved righteousness, "},{"t":"and","s":["H5769"]},{"t":" hated wickedness. Therefore God, "},{"t":"your","s":["H5769"]},{"t":" God, has anointed "},{"t":"you","s":["H5703"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"with","s":["H7626"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H7626"]},{"t":" oil "},{"t":"of","s":["H7626"]},{"t":" gladness above "},{"t":"your","s":["H5769"]},{"t":" fellows."}]},{"n":8,"text":"All your garments smell like myrrh, aloes, and cassia. Out of ivory palaces stringed instruments have made you glad.","tok":[{"t":"All","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"your","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" garments smell "},{"t":"like","s":["H3651"]},{"t":" myrrh, aloes, "},{"t":"and","s":["H8081"]},{"t":" cassia. "},{"t":"Out","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"of","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" ivory palaces stringed instruments "},{"t":"have","s":["H7562"]},{"t":" made "},{"t":"you","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" glad."}]},{"n":9,"text":"Kings’ daughters are among your honorable women. At your right hand the queen stands in gold of Ophir.","tok":[{"t":"Kings’ daughters "},{"t":"are","s":["H8127"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"among","s":["H4480"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"your","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" honorable women. "},{"t":"At","s":["H1964"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"your","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" right hand "},{"t":"the","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" queen stands "},{"t":"in","s":["H8055"]},{"t":" gold "},{"t":"of","s":["H4480"]},{"t":" Ophir."}]},{"n":10,"text":"Listen, daughter, consider, and turn your ear. Forget your own people, and also your father’s house.","tok":[{"t":"Listen, "},{"t":"daughter","s":["H1323"],"a":[1]},{"t":", consider, "},{"t":"and","s":["H4428"]},{"t":" turn "},{"t":"your","s":["H4428"]},{"t":" ear. Forget "},{"t":"your","s":["H4428"]},{"t":" own people, "},{"t":"and","s":["H4428"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"also","s":["H4428"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"your","s":["H4428"]},{"t":" father’s house."}]},{"n":11,"text":"So the king will desire your beauty, honor him, for he is your lord.","tok":[{"t":"So","s":["H7200"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H8085"]},{"t":" king "},{"t":"will","s":["H5971"]},{"t":" desire "